SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Easy 40–50 min run @ 6:30–7:00/km (ap
 prox. 6–7km) — treat as
DESCRIPTION:Easy 40–50 min run @ 6:30–7:00/km (approx. 6–7km) — tre
 at as a movement check-in\, not a long run\; stop early if any fatigue or 
 illness symptoms return.\n\nReason: A 19km long run the day after returnin
 g from near-zero training load and illness is a significant injury risk\; 
 a short easy run reintroduces running stress safely while protecting recov
 ery ahead of the swim-focused build.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-29
END:VEVENT
